[{"client_msg_id":"0cdd0e15-09e4-427f-b509-0784b97b67f0","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"```For example, using long_description = open(\"README.md\").read() in setup.py is a common mistake. Many Windows users cannot install such packages if there is at least one non-ASCII character (e.g. emoji, author names, copyright symbols, and the like) in their UTF-8-encoded README.md file.\n\nOf the 4000 most downloaded packages from PyPI, 489 use non-ASCII characters in their README, and 82 fail to install from source on non-UTF-8 locales due to not specifying an encoding for a non-ASCII file. [1]```","ts":"1637829520.426700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uFZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3093e133-1e23-4997-a033-828cb0bd2f42","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"\u003chttps://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0597/#using-the-default-encoding-is-a-common-mistake\u003e","ts":"1637829484.426200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Python.org: PEP 597 -- Add optional EncodingWarning","id":1,"title":"PEP 597 -- Add optional EncodingWarning","title_link":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0597/#using-the-default-encoding-is-a-common-mistake","text":"The official home of the Python Programming Language","thumb_url":"https://www.python.org/static/opengraph-icon-200x200.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Python.org","service_icon":"https://www.python.org/static/apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0597/#using-the-default-encoding-is-a-common-mistake","original_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0597/#using-the-default-encoding-is-a-common-mistake"}],"edited":{"user":"UA4RVLHK7","ts":"1637829495.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+mCBj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32c31129-e786-410f-ba28-dd1c0a1d119e","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"僕がPEPに書いたやつ","ts":"1637829484.426000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1MT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db4b95cc-c815-414e-8936-139b0f69cfae","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"よくあるミスですね。","ts":"1637829444.425800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"83g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63f0f8ef-e168-496e-86ba-dee7bdb9f6fd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"dotty-dict が install できないのはコレ\n\u003chttps://github.com/pawelzny/dotty_dict/issues/69\u003e","ts":"1637829084.425500","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/pawelzny/dotty_dict/issues/69|#69 Special characters in the author's name\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/pawelzny/dotty_dict/issues/69|#69 Special characters in the author's name\u003e","text":"The author's name contains special characters that prevent the installation on Windows with Japanese encoding.\n\npip raises the following error:\n\n```\nFile \"C:\\Users\\test\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\pip-install-qogza7z4\\dotty-dict\\setup.py\", line 16, in \u0026lt;module\u0026gt;\n        readme = readme_file.read()\nUnicodeDecodeError: 'cp932' codec can't decode byte 0x82 in position 119: illegal multibyte sequence\n\n```","fields":[{"title":"Assignees","value":"@pawelzny","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"8","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/pawelzny/dotty_dict|pawelzny/dotty_dict\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1607181701}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VfXNo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd54c7d0-5a20-44e0-a646-3b5514daee3a","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"PYTHONUTF8=1にすると、ファイルやパイプをテキストモードで開くときのデフォルトエンコーディングもutf-8になるので、Python起動後にstdoutが置き換えられるケースにも効く","ts":"1637828989.425100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W8eq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ab5c16d-a7a7-4143-b780-c5e92a8ff1c3","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"PYTHONIOENCODINGは起動時に作られるstdout等のエンコーディングを指定できますが、起動後にstdoutを置き換えるとかされたら効かない","ts":"1637828946.424300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/HTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afc7055a-4367-4f56-82cb-8489abeb62c2","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"Pythonのstdoutがファイルとかパイプとかにつながってて、だれかがそのファイルやパイプをコンソールに中継していると問題が起こる。","ts":"1637828888.423600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CY/K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e20b0645-dba4-45eb-af66-2e61d0dae8d2","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"を使ってるので、PYTHONIOENCODINGもPYTHONUTF8も関係ないのです","ts":"1637828820.422800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7bLI="}]},{"client_msg_id":"536355a5-fc84-4ec4-a8e0-16d7cb4a8ec1","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"普通はコンソールに書くのはWriteConsoleW","ts":"1637828806.422300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2bN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"585d5e0f-e532-4d2c-b62b-0b0f68a3eca1","type":"message","user":"UA4RVLHK7","text":"なんだろう。stdoutが何か変なのにラップされてる気がする","ts":"1637828795.422000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ajZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cb1ca73-6380-445b-9feb-c92aee563d37","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああそれぼくもあったな。QMKで必要なdottyだったかな。それをWindowsに入れるときにpipにPYTHONUTF8=1を指定しないと死ぬの。","ts":"1637816159.421400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=3u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68310500-eb42-44c9-9f3b-fb5e889a3338","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"PYTHONIOENCODINGとかで指定するのやめて、PYTHONUTF8=1にしたら解決したっぽいです","ts":"1637812220.420200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RdIAi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ba3a0d7-9ecf-4fda-9288-4e87a16d6809","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なってました　WindowsTerminal です","ts":"1637812187.419100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SFA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55e6a665-722a-40e9-a504-0c5f7448bc0b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"あと、ターミナルアプリは何使ってます？","ts":"1637809608.418500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xp9D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5de4f728-d9c7-4e6a-b1de-0eaf5a89526b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"LANG 環境変数は ja_JP.utf-8 になってます？","ts":"1637809426.418000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wh+E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3b5733a-0e50-4f62-ba6e-1b637d76c09b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"起動時にUnicodeDecodeError出るようになっちゃったんですけど、utf8にしろっていろんなサイトで出てきたからそうしてみたけどだめだった","ts":"1637809071.417100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dgnnj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2089f22-59bc-4f70-a4ae-2febf9c4843c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほどわからん","ts":"1637809016.415600","files":[{"id":"F02N50TF82K","created":1637809011,"timestamp":1637809011,"name":"20211125_115357.jpg","title":"20211125_115357.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U01D9BALEKU","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":1233652,"url"